  <item>
    <title>City Pop | 霓虹回响的旋律之旅</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66d1b623422703e0edcdf012</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d1b623422703e0edcdf012</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 30 Aug 2024 12:08:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们一定都有幻想过在落日余晖间蓝粉色交替的天空，无数男女从疲倦的工作抽身而出，涌入城市夜幕，期待着落日飞车的一场浪漫邂逅。霓虹斑驳的城市间，需要属于身处城市的bgm。本期节目我们一起来感受非常具有城市气质的「city pop」城市流行这种音乐类型。</span><br><span>我们会以city pop的起源地日本的歌手为主，开启这期节目。除了日本，节目里还包含来自泰国，韩国以及华语地区多个歌手的作品。了解一种音乐风格在全球各地的推广和变化。</span></p><span></span><p><span>歌单🎵：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">01:20</a>《风街ろまん》-Happy End</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="355">05:55</a>《ろっかばいまいべいびい》-Tin Pan Alley</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="680">11:20</a>《RIDE ON TIME》-山下達郎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="970">16:10</a>《雨のウェンズデイ》-大瀧詠一</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1195">19:55</a>《真夜中のドア/Stay With Me》-松原みき</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1460">24:20</a> 《ミック・ジャガーに微笑みを》-中森明菜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1775">29:35</a>《OH NO,OH YES》-中森明菜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2125">35:25</a>《Cats eye》-杏里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2370">39:30</a>《Airport Lady》-角松敏生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">44:00</a>《Lover Boy》-Phum Viphurit</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2895">48:15</a>《Grace》-ADOY</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3150">52:30</a>《关不掉的收音机》-黄韵玲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3355">55:55</a>《若我告訴你其實我愛的只是你》-张雨生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3640">60:40</a>《数字恋爱》-范晓萱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3965">66:05</a>《Shall WeChat》-李行亮</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4195">69:55</a>《走路的女孩》-蓝心湄</span></p>]]></description>
