  <item>
    <title>「奥运会主题曲」全球共鸣的乐章，音符里的奥运精神</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/669be8bb8fcadceb90ba1252</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">669be8bb8fcadceb90ba1252</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 20 Jul 2024 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>#奥运会#从古老的奥林匹克山到现代的全球舞台，几乎每一届奥运会都以其独特的主题曲，向世界宣告着和平、友谊与进步的永恒主题。经典的旋律记录那些难忘的瞬间，在往后每一次重温中，我们都可以再次感受每一次心跳与梦想的共鸣。 作为一场全球瞩目的体育盛事的主题曲，它不仅仅是音符的堆砌，更是人类团结、拼搏、梦想的见证者。每个国家都在创作编排上费劲巧思，通过音乐这种艺术形式来传递自己对爱与和平的愿景……</span></p><span></span><p><span>歌单🎵：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="95">01:35</a> 萨马拉斯颂歌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="357">05:57</a> До свиданья, Москва</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="615">10:15</a> Reach Out</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1005">16:45</a> Hand In Hand</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1190">19:50</a> Barcelona</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1515">25:15</a> Amigos Para Siempre (Friends for Life)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> The Power Of The Dream</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2122">35:22</a> Reach</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2405">40:05</a> The Flame</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2690">44:50</a> Pass the flame</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3095">51:35</a> 我和你</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3400">56:40</a> Survival</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3745">62:25</a> Alma e Coração</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4083">68:03</a> 东京五轮音头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4362">72:42</a> 巡游盛典（英文名为Parade）巴黎奥运会主题曲</span></p>]]></description>
